<view class="page">
  <view class="tip">设置登录账号与密码，之后可用「账号 + 密码」登录。账号可自填或保留系统生成的。</view>

  <view class="item">
    <view class="label">账号</view>
    <input class="input" placeholder="4-32 位字母/数字/下划线" placeholder-class="ph"
           value="{{username}}" bindinput="onUsername" />
  </view>

  <view class="item">
    <view class="label">密码</view>
    <input class="input" password placeholder="至少 6 位" placeholder-class="ph"
           value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPassword" />
  </view>

  <button class="save" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}">保存</button>
</view>